{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-10-20 07:21:00', 'title': 'SBI SECURITIES CENTRALISES SETTLEMENT OPERATIONS WITH BROADRIDGE', 'text': "TOKYO, OCT. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TO ENHANCE SERVICES TO ITS CLIENTS AND FURTHER AUTOMATE OPERATIONS ACROSS BUSINESS LINES, SBI SECURITIES CO., LTD.,\xa0ONE OF JAPAN'S LARGEST ONLINE SECURITIES COMPANIES, HAS EXPANDED ITS BUSINESS RELATIONSHIP WITH\xa0BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC.\xa0(NYSE:BR), A GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER."}